# Real tree-sitter grammar repos commit the generated src/parser.c,
# src/grammar.json, and src/node-types.json alongside grammar.js and
# scanner.c -- downstream consumers (editors, language bindings, Zed's
# extension builder) compile parser.c + scanner.c directly and generally
# don't run `tree-sitter generate` themselves. Only truly transient
# build/install artifacts are ignored here.

node_modules/
build/
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.wasm
/target
Cargo.lock
*.log
